  "item_short_desc": "<p>Crafted after the classic PT uniform, these military shorts are designed for high-performance workouts. The moisture-wicking and breathable material composition ensures durability, making them perfect for running, boxing, weightlifting, and more. Featuring stretch side panels and a supportive spandex lining, these shorts provide comfort and flexibility during intense exercises. The hidden waist pocket is convenient for small items, and the boxer-style lining wicks away sweat, complemented by an extra hidden pocket on the left leg.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
